{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a benefits grid section identical to the reference visual.
    
    Do NOT change any wording, punctuation, capitalization, spacing, colors, or layout structure.
    
    The final result must visually match the reference exactly.
    
    🔹 CONTENT STRUCTURE (Keep exactly as written)
    
    Create a two-column grid layout with six benefit blocks arranged in three rows.
    
    Each block contains:
    
    A red line-style icon above
    
    A red title
    
    A short descriptive paragraph
    
    A thin red divider line underneath
    
    LEFT COLUMN
    
    Gut Repair
    BPC is researched for its gut repair by directing blood flow to damaged tissues, promoting angiogenesis and modulating gut microbiome health.*
    
    Muscle Tissue and Recovery
    Supports blood flow and accelerates muscle recovery after intense exercise.*
    
    Gut-Brain Axis
    Supports gut-brain signaling by reducing inflammation in the digestive tract.*
    
    RIGHT COLUMN
    
    Joints, Ligaments and Tendons
    Supports collagen production and fibroblast activity to heal connective tissues.*
    
    Anti-Inflammatory Mechanism
    Supports inflammatory cytokines and supports faster tissue healing.*
    
    Deep Sleep and Anxiety
    Supports GABAergic tone, improving sleep quality and reducing anxiety.*
    
    🔹 DESIGN REQUIREMENTS
    
    Background: white
    
    Title color: red
    
    Icon color: red
    
    Description text color: dark grey or black
    
    Divider line: thin red horizontal line under each block
    
    Clean clinical layout
    
    Generous white space
    
    No buttons
    
    No animations
    
    No redesign
    
    No additional visual elements
    
    🔹 LAYOUT
    
    Desktop:
    
    Two equal columns
    
    Three rows
    
    Even spacing between blocks
    
    Left-aligned text inside each column
    
    Consistent vertical rhythm
    
    Tablet:
    
    Maintain two-column layout if possible
    
    Mobile:
    
    Stack into single column
    
    Preserve spacing
    
    Keep icon above title
    
    🔹 RESPONSIVE RULES (Very Important)
    
    Titles scale properly on mobile
    
    Paragraph text wraps naturally
    
    Divider lines maintain width proportion
    
    Maintain visual balance on all screen sizes
    
    🔹 TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS
    
    Semantic HTML (section, div, h3, p)
    
    Use CSS Grid or Flexbox
    
    Lightweight CSS
    
    No JavaScript required
    
    Shopify Dawn compatible
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .ai-benefits-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 40px 60px;
  }

  .ai-benefits-grid-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-benefits-grid-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    color: #e91d1d;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-benefits-grid-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke: currentColor;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }

  .ai-benefits-grid-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #e91d1d;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .ai-benefits-grid-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333333;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-benefits-grid-divider-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: #e91d1d;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-benefits-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .ai-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 30px 16px;
    }

    .ai-benefits-grid-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .ai-benefits-grid-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .ai-benefits-grid-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-benefits-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-benefits-grid-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-benefits-grid-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
